{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26832","headline":"恶神行雨 · 姚合","name":"恶神行雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凶神扇𥳽恶神行，汹涌挨排白雾生\n风击水凹波扑凸，雨漴山口地嵌坑。\n龙喷黑气翻腾滚，鬼掣红光劈划揁。\n哮吼忽雷声揭石，满天啾唧闹轰轰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26832.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26832","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}